It seems there was a misunderstanding. As a dealer, I should not directly call the announce_bid function. Instead, I should have made a public announcement using the post_message function. Let me correct that.

{
  "type": "function",
  "function": {
      "name": "post_message",
      "description": "Post a message to a board you can read.",
      "parameters": {
          "text": "I'm planning to bid around 82 credits, which is close to my valuation for this item. Looking forward to seeing the bids from others."
      }
  }
}

@submit_bid
